# minimal char.def exercising every accepted record form.
# Ranges deliberately sit in gaps of the built-in table so the merged
# table stays non-overlapping.
DEFAULT 0 1 0
KANJI 0 0 2
KATAKANA 1 1 2
0x3001 SYMBOL  # single-codepoint form, trailing comment
0x2E80..0x2EF0 KANJI
0x31F0..0x31FF KATAKANA
0xFF61..0xFF65 SYMBOL
